## 6. State Management (Zustand Stores)

### 6.1 Transport Store (`/src/lib/store/useTransportStore.ts`)

```typescript
interface TransportStore {
  playState: PlayState;
  bpm: number;
  currentStep: number;   // For UI highlight (updated via requestAnimationFrame)
  swing: number;
  metronomeEnabled: boolean;

  play: () => void;
  pause: () => void;
  stop: () => void;
  setBpm: (bpm: number) => void;
  setCurrentStep: (step: number) => void;
  setSwing: (swing: number) => void;
  toggleMetronome: () => void;
}
```

**Key design decision:** `currentStep` is updated from the scheduler via `requestAnimationFrame` for visual sync. The audio scheduling runs independently on its precise clock. The UI "chases" the audio, never the other way around.

### 6.2 Pattern Store (`/src/lib/store/usePatternStore.ts`)

